<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>GitHub Security Assessment — SecureLayer</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Pre-audited open-source repositories scored across 6 security checks. See which tools are safe to install — updated weekly." />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #0a0f0f;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    /* ── Browser chrome (Brave) ── */
    .browser-window { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

    .browser-titlebar {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
      background: #170f20; padding: 10px 16px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2038;
    }
    .traffic-lights { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding-bottom: 10px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .tl { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .tl.red { background: #ff5f57; }
    .tl.yellow { background: #febc2e; }
    .tl.green { background: #28c840; }

    .browser-tab {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: #241a30; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
      padding: 8px 12px; max-width: 260px;
    }
    .tab-favicon { width: 15px; height: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .tab-title { font-size: 12.5px; color: #e4dcf0; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .tab-close { margin-left: auto; color: #7a6f8c; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .tab-add { color: #7a6f8c; font-size: 18px; padding: 0 10px 10px; line-height: 1; align-self: center; }
    .tab-chevron { color: #7a6f8c; font-size: 11px; margin-left: auto; padding-bottom: 10px; align-self: center; }

    .browser-navbar {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
      background: #1d1428; padding: 10px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2038;
    }
    .nav-icon { color: #8a7fa0; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .nav-icon svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
    .nav-icon.disabled { color: #453b56; }
    .address-pill {
      flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: #2a2038; border-radius: 7px; padding: 7px 14px;
      max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .address-pill svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; color: #8a7fa0; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .addr-text { font-size: 13px; color: #e4dcf0; }
    .addr-path { color: #8a7fa0; }
    .nav-divider { width: 1px; height: 20px; background: #362a48; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .nav-brave { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .nav-menu svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

    .browser-body { flex: 1; }

    /* ── Hero ── */
    .assess-hero { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(94,234,212,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(94,234,212,.2);
      color: #5eead4; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .assess-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.6vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .assess-hero h1 span { color: #5eead4; }
    .assess-hero-sub { color: #999; font-size: .9375rem; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── Layout ── */
    .assess-wrap  { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 48px; }
    .assess-body-hidden { display: none; }
    .assess-status { color: #888; font-size: .875rem; text-align: center; padding: 48px 0; }

    /* ── Grade group ── */
    .grade-group { margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .grade-group-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a3030;
    }
    .grade-letter {
      font-size: .875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      min-width: 34px;
      height: 26px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0 5px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }
    .grade-label { font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 600; color: #888; }
    .grade-count {
      font-size: .7rem;
      color: #888;
      background: #0d1a1a;
      border: 1px solid #1a3030;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1px 7px;
      margin-left: auto;
    }
    .grade-letter-below {
      color: #9ca3af;
      background: rgba(156,163,175,.14);
      font-size: .75rem;
      letter-spacing: -.25px;
    }

    .grade-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 6px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .grade-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* ── Compact cards ── */
    .assess-card {
      background: #0d1a1a;
      border: 1px solid #1a3030;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: border-color .15s;
    }
    .assess-card:hover   { border-color: rgba(94,234,212,.35); }
    .assess-card.expanded { border-color: rgba(94,234,212,.5); }

    .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
    }
    .card-main  { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .card-repo  {
      font-size: .8125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5eead4;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: block;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .card-repo:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .card-chips-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .card-chip {
      font-size: .65rem;
      color: #888;
      background: #142424;
      border: 1px solid #1a3030;
      border-radius: 3px;
      padding: 1px 5px;
    }

    .card-expand { font-size: .7rem; color: #888; flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* ── Footer bar (always visible) ── */
    .card-footer-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 8px 14px 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid #1a3030;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .card-date  { font-size: .6rem; color: #888; align-self: flex-end; }
    .card-footer-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 4px; }
    .card-dots      { display: flex; gap: 3px; align-items: center; }
    .card-dot       { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .card-dot-locked { filter: blur(1.5px); opacity: .45; }
    .card-score-val {
      font-size: .7rem;
      color: #888;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* ── Expanded details ── */
    .card-details { border-top: 1px solid #1a3030; }
    .card-desc-row {
      font-size: .75rem;
      color: #888;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a3030;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .check-row-sm {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 7px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1a3030;
      font-size: .75rem;
    }
    .check-row-sm:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .check-icon-sm { font-size: .8rem; min-width: 14px; }
    .check-row-sm.pass .check-icon-sm { color: #4ade80; }
    .check-row-sm.fail .check-icon-sm { color: #f87171; }
    .check-row-sm.warn .check-icon-sm { color: #f59e0b; }
    .check-name-sm { flex: 1; color: #e0e0e0; }
    .check-row-sm.fail .check-name-sm { color: #888; }
    .check-pts { font-size: .7rem; color: #888; white-space: nowrap; }

    /* ── Live scan CTA ── */
    .livescan-cta { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 64px; border-top: 1px solid #1a3030; }
    .livescan-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; background: #0d1a1a; border: 1px solid #1a3030; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px 32px; }
    .livescan-eyebrow { font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5eead4; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .livescan-text h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .livescan-text p  { font-size: .8125rem; color: #999; max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .livescan-btn { flex-shrink: 0; background: none; border: 1px solid #1a3030; border-radius: 8px; color: #e0e0e0; font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; transition: border-color .15s, color .15s; }
    .livescan-btn:hover { border-color: #5eead4; color: #5eead4; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .livescan-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: 20px; } }

    /* ── Locked CTA row (D/F expanded details) ── */
    .check-row-locked { background: rgba(251,146,60,.06); border-top: 1px dashed rgba(251,146,60,.3) !important; }
    .check-row-locked .check-name-sm { color: #888; font-style: italic; }
    .locked-cta {
      display: block;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      font-size: .75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fb923c;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #1a3030;
    }
    .locked-cta:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* ── Incident chip + row ── */
    .chip-incident { color: #f87171 !important; border-color: rgba(248,113,113,.35) !important; }
    .incident-row { background: rgba(239,68,68,.08); }
    .incident-row .check-icon-sm { color: #f87171; }
    .incident-row .check-name-sm { color: #fca5a5; font-weight: 600; }
    .incident-pts { color: #f87171 !important; font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── OpenSSF chip + supplementary row (in expanded details) ── */
    .chip-openssf { color: #a78bfa !important; border-color: rgba(167,139,250,.35) !important; }
    .openssf-row .check-icon-sm { color: #a78bfa; }
    .openssf-row .check-name-sm { color: #888; font-style: italic; }
    .openssf-row { border-top: 1px dashed #1a3030; }

    /* ── Note ── */
    .assess-note { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 64px; color: #888; font-size: .7rem; }

    /* ── Mobile: drop the icon row, keep tab + address pill only ── */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .browser-tab { max-width: 140px; }
      .tab-add, .tab-chevron { display: none; }
      .nav-icon, .nav-divider, .nav-brave, .nav-fox, .nav-menu, .vpn-badge, .private-badge { display: none; }
      .address-pill { max-width: none; margin: 0; }
    }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    .site-footer { border-top: 1px solid #1a3030; padding: 40px 24px; text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; }
    .site-footer p { color: #888; font-size: 13px; }
    .footer-links { margin-top: 14px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; }
    .footer-links a { font-size: 12px; color: #888; text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #5eead4; }
    .footer-green-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; opacity: .85; transition: opacity .2s; }
    .footer-green-link:hover { opacity: 1; }
    .footer-green-link img { display: block; width: 60px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; }
    .footer-copy { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 11px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="browser-window">
  <div class="browser-titlebar">
    <div class="traffic-lights">
      <span class="tl red"></span><span class="tl yellow"></span><span class="tl green"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="browser-tab">
      <img class="tab-favicon" src="/favicon.svg" alt="" />
      <span class="tab-title">GitHub Security Assessment — SecureLayer</span>
      <span class="tab-close">&times;</span>
    </div>
    <span class="tab-add">+</span>
    <span class="tab-chevron">&#9660;</span>
  </div>
  <div class="browser-navbar">
    <span class="nav-icon nav-back"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
    <span class="nav-icon nav-forward disabled"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
    <span class="nav-icon nav-reload"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 14-5.3M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-14 5.3M4 4v5h5M20 20v-5h-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
    <span class="nav-icon nav-bookmark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 3h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v17l-7-4-7 4V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
    <div class="address-pill">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 6h16M7 12h10M10 18h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      <span class="addr-text">securelayer.co<span class="addr-path">/github-security-assessment/</span></span>
    </div>
    <span class="nav-divider"></span>
    <img class="nav-brave" src="/images/dock-icons/brave.png" alt="Brave" />
    <span class="nav-menu"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
  </div>
  <div class="browser-body">

    <div class="assess-hero">
      <div class="hero-badge">Security Intelligence</div>
      <h1>Repository Security <span>Assessments</span></h1>
      <p class="assess-hero-sub">
        We audit popular open-source repos across 8 security checks before you install them.
        Scores are pre-computed — no live API calls, no rate limits.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grade groups rendered by JS -->
    <section class="assess-wrap">
      <div id="assess-status" class="assess-status">Loading assessments…</div>
      <div id="assess-body" class="assess-body-hidden"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Live scan CTA -->
    <section class="livescan-cta">
      <div class="livescan-inner">
        <div class="livescan-text">
          <div class="livescan-eyebrow">Coming soon</div>
          <h2>Want to scan your own repo?</h2>
          <p>Live scanning with GitHub OAuth is in our roadmap. Vote to tell us you want it — we'll build it when we hit our milestone.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="https://github.securelayer.co" class="livescan-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vote to build this →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="assess-note">ⓘ Scores pre-computed weekly using the GitHub API and OpenSSF Scorecard. A–B grades are shown individually. C through F repos are grouped under "Below Security Baseline" — specific gap details are kept private to avoid creating a targeted attack surface. An active security incident deducts 10 pts from the base score.</p>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <p>Choose cybersecurity, it's cheaper.</p>
      <p class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
        <a href="/sustainability">Environment</a>
      </p>
      <a href="/sustainability" class="footer-green-link">
        <img src="/gwf-badge.png" alt="This website runs on green hosting - verified by thegreenwebfoundation.org" />
      </a>
      <p class="footer-copy">&copy; 2026 SecureLayer. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

  </div>
</div>
<script is:inline src="/scripts/assessment.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
